  "notable_quotes": [
    "The [Zn0.93Ni0.07(C2O4)(dmiz)2] structure is a one-dimensional zigzag chain in space group C2/c with a = 14.5252(7) Å, b = 12.1916(8) Å, c = 8.6850(8) Å, β = 97.460(6)°.",
    "The chain consists of octahedral metal centers with an MN2O4 donor set from two cis dmiz ligands and two cis tetradentate bridging oxalato ligands.",
    "In the reported frequency, field, and temperature windows, all samples were EPR silent, indicating detectability is conditional on measurement regime."
